('personal-training-3-months', 'PERSONAL TRAINING (3 MONTHS)', 'personal-training-3-months', '🏆 3 months Personal Training Package – For Enhanced & Natural Athletes Whether you’re a natural athlete or using anabolics, our 1-year personal training package is designed to optimize your physique with science-backed training, nutrition, and recovery strategies. ✅ Customized Training Plans – Tailored workouts for size, strength, or conditioning.✅ Goal-Specific Nutrition – Meal plans for lean gains, fat loss, or contest prep.✅ Performance Monitoring – Regular assessments & progress tracking.✅ Enhanced Athlete Guidance – Safe cycle planning, PCT support, and health monitoring.✅ 24/7 Support & Adjustments – Stay on track with expert guidance. 📲 Join the Muscle Factory Team & The Bodybuilding Doctor for elite coaching! 💪 Book your transformation today!', '<ul>\n<li>\n<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"79\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"77\">🏆 3 months Personal Training Package – For Enhanced &amp; Natural Athletes</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"292\">Whether you&#8217;re a <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"117\">natural athlete</strong> or using <strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"140\">anabolics</strong>, our <strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"182\">1-year personal training package</strong> is designed to optimize your physique with <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"289\">science-backed training, nutrition, and recovery strategies</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"720\">✅ <strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"325\">Customized Training Plans</strong> – Tailored workouts for size, strength, or conditioning.<br data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"385\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"414\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Goal-Specific Nutrition</strong> – Meal plans for <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"473\">lean gains, fat loss, or contest prep</strong>.<br data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"477\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"505\">Performance Monitoring</strong> – Regular assessments &amp; progress tracking.<br data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"551\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"582\">Enhanced Athlete Guidance</strong> – Safe <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"644\">cycle planning, PCT support, and health monitoring</strong>.<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"680\">24/7 Support &amp; Adjustments</strong> – Stay on track with expert guidance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"842\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">📲 <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"803\">Join the Muscle Factory Team &amp; The Bodybuilding Doctor for elite coaching!</strong> 💪 <strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"842\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Book your transformation today!</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>', 'https://triotradellc.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Best-Personal-Trainer-in-Dubai.jpg', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Coaching', 1, 2000000, 0, 0, 11, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-05 18:14:24'),
('Fng10ff5GLOav0fxAw2XngcC', 'Bodybuilding Nutrition Blueprint', 'bodybuilding-nutrition-blueprint', 'Bodybuilding Nutrition Blueprint Master the Science of Building Muscle, Losing Fat & Fueling PerformanceNutrition is one of the most misunderstood aspects of bodybuilding. Most athletes follow meal plans without understanding why they work, making it difficult to adjust their diet as their goals change.Bodybuilding Nutrition Blueprint is a complete evidence-based course designed to help you understand the principles behind effective nutrition for muscle growth, fat loss, performance, and contest preparation. Rather than teaching you what to eat for a few weeks, this course teaches you how to build, modify, and optimize your own nutrition plan for life.Whether you\'re a beginner looking to build your first diet, an experienced bodybuilder aiming to maximize your physique, or a coach wanting a deeper understanding of nutrition, this course provides practical knowledge you can immediately apply.What You\'ll LearnPrinciples of bodybuilding nutritionCalories, maintenance, surplus & deficitProtein, carbohydrates & dietary fats explainedBuilding effective diet plansOff-season nutrition strategiesContest preparation nutritionMeal timing & nutrient distributionPractical athlete case studiesCourse Includes✅ 8 High-Definition Video Lectures✅ Downloadable PDF Notes✅ Calorie & Macro Calculation Guide✅ Food Substitution Guide✅ Sample Diet Plans✅ Meal Timing Strategies✅ Lifetime Access✅ Future Course Updates IncludedWho Is This Course For?BodybuildersFitness EnthusiastsPersonal TrainersNutrition CoachesContest Prep AthletesAnyone looking to build muscle or lose body fat scientificallyLaunch Offer💰 One-Time Payment: ₹4,999No subscriptions. No recurring fees.Why This Course?The goal isn\'t to give you another meal plan.The goal is to teach you the science and practical application of bodybuilding nutrition so you can confidently make nutritional decisions for yourself or your clients.Stop copying diets. Learn how to build your own.Coach VarunThe Bodybuilding DoctorEvidence. Experience. Results.', '<h2><strong>Bodybuilding Nutrition Blueprint</strong></h2><p> </p><h3><strong>Master the Science of Building Muscle, Losing Fat &amp; Fueling Performance</strong></h3><p>Nutrition is one of the most misunderstood aspects of bodybuilding. Most athletes follow meal plans without understanding why they work, making it difficult to adjust their diet as their goals change.</p><p><strong>Bodybuilding Nutrition Blueprint</strong> is a complete evidence-based course designed to help you understand the principles behind effective nutrition for muscle growth, fat loss, performance, and contest preparation. Rather than teaching you what to eat for a few weeks, this course teaches you how to build, modify, and optimize your own nutrition plan for life.</p><p>Whether you\'re a beginner looking to build your first diet, an experienced bodybuilder aiming to maximize your physique, or a coach wanting a deeper understanding of nutrition, this course provides practical knowledge you can immediately apply.</p><h3><strong>What You\'ll Learn</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Principles of bodybuilding nutrition</p></li><li><p>Calories, maintenance, surplus &amp; deficit</p></li><li><p>Protein, carbohydrates &amp; dietary fats explained</p></li><li><p>Building effective diet plans</p></li><li><p>Off-season nutrition strategies</p></li><li><p>Contest preparation nutrition</p></li><li><p>Meal timing &amp; nutrient distribution</p></li><li><p>Practical athlete case studies</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Course Includes</strong></h3><p>✅ 8 High-Definition Video Lectures</p><p>✅ Downloadable PDF Notes</p><p>✅ Calorie &amp; Macro Calculation Guide</p><p>✅ Food Substitution Guide</p><p>✅ Sample Diet Plans</p><p>✅ Meal Timing Strategies</p><p>✅ Lifetime Access</p><p>✅ Future Course Updates Included</p><h3><strong>Who Is This Course For?</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Bodybuilders</p></li><li><p>Fitness Enthusiasts</p></li><li><p>Personal Trainers</p></li><li><p>Nutrition Coaches</p></li><li><p>Contest Prep Athletes</p></li><li><p>Anyone looking to build muscle or lose body fat scientifically</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Launch Offer</strong></h3><p>💰 <strong>One-Time Payment: ₹4,999</strong></p><p>No subscriptions. No recurring fees.</p><h3><strong>Why This Course?</strong></h3><p>The goal isn\'t to give you another meal plan.</p><p>The goal is to teach you the science and practical application of bodybuilding nutrition so you can confidently make nutritional decisions for yourself or your clients.</p><p><strong>Stop copying diets. Learn how to build your own.</strong></p><p><strong>Coach Varun</strong><br><strong>The Bodybuilding Doctor</strong><br><em>Evidence. Experience. Results.</em></p>', 'https://thebodybuildingdoctor.com/storage/courses/eyyZrSvFsZPYNNgKaGScMjWfe4HiYYXQjcgLFYXE.png', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Training', 1, 499999, 3, 5982, 0, '2026-07-23 19:58:42', '2026-07-25 23:28:52'),
('fertility-protocol', 'RECOVERY BLUEPRINT COURSE', 'fertility-protocol', 'A Complete 3-Month Guide to Reversing the Effects of Steroid UseWelcome to the Recovery Blueprint – a structured 12-week course designed exclusively for enhanced athletes, coaches, and fitness enthusiasts who want to understand what truly happens after steroid use and how to take control of recovery.📌 What You’ll Learn:How your body responds when you come off cycleThe science behind hormonal recovery & why PCTs often failNutrition strategies to support healing & balanceSmart supplementation for liver, kidneys, heart, and mental healthAdvanced recovery protocols for long-term wellness and fertility✅ Why This Course is Different:Unlike generic advice, this program is built on real athlete experience, science-based strategies, and years of coaching enhanced clients. Every module is broken into simple, actionable steps with video lessons, protocols, and case studies.📅 Duration:12 Weeks (3 Months) of structured learning & applicationYour Coach:Coach Varun – Founder of Team Muscle Factory & The Bodybuilding Doctor, with years of experience guiding athletes on enhancement, recovery, and competition prep.', '<p><strong>A Complete 3-Month Guide to Reversing the Effects of Steroid Use</strong></p><p>Welcome to the <strong>Recovery Blueprint</strong> – a structured 12-week course designed exclusively for enhanced athletes, coaches, and fitness enthusiasts who want to understand what truly happens <em>after steroid use</em> and how to take control of recovery.</p><h3>📌 What You’ll Learn:</h3><ul><li><p>How your body responds when you come off cycle</p></li><li><p>The science behind hormonal recovery &amp; why PCTs often fail</p></li><li><p>Nutrition strategies to support healing &amp; balance</p></li><li><p>Smart supplementation for liver, kidneys, heart, and mental health</p></li><li><p>Advanced recovery protocols for long-term wellness and fertility</p></li></ul><h3>✅ Why This Course is Different:</h3><p>Unlike generic advice, this program is built on <strong>real athlete experience, science-based strategies, and years of coaching enhanced clients.</strong> Every module is broken into simple, actionable steps with video lessons, protocols, and case studies.</p><h3>📅 Duration:</h3><ul><li><p><strong>12 Weeks</strong> (3 Months) of structured learning &amp; application</p></li></ul><h3>Your Coach:</h3><p>Coach Varun – Founder of <strong>Team Muscle Factory</strong> &amp; <strong>The Bodybuilding Doctor</strong>, with years of experience guiding athletes on enhancement, recovery, and competition prep.</p>', 'https://triotradellc.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ChatGPT-Image-Apr-6-2026-09_03_39-PM.png', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Performance', 1, 2000000, 49, 0, 14, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-05 18:30:56'),
('fUpihhLTc8xhCaiPbmfuUr11', 'Contest Prep Blueprint- A Complete Science & Strategy of Peak Week', 'contest-prep-blueprint-a-complete-science-strategy-of-peak-week', 'Contest Prep BlueprintThe Science & Strategy of Competitive BodybuildingContest Prep Blueprint is a comprehensive educational course designed to teach the complete science and practical application of bodybuilding contest preparation.Whether you are a first-time competitor, an experienced athlete, a bodybuilding coach, or a fitness professional, this course provides a structured framework for understanding every phase of a successful contest preparation—from the initial assessment to stepping on stage in peak condition.Unlike generic dieting courses, Contest Prep Blueprint explains why every decision is made, helping you understand the principles behind nutrition, training, cardio, monitoring, peak week, competition day, and post-contest recovery.This course combines scientific knowledge with practical coaching experience, allowing you to learn the systems used during real bodybuilding contest preparations.What You\'ll Learn✔ How to determine the ideal time to begin contest preparation✔ How to assess an athlete before starting prep✔ Nutrition strategies throughout every phase of prep✔ Training modifications required during a calorie deficit✔ Cardio planning and progression✔ Monitoring progress using objective data✔ Weekly adjustment strategies✔ Common problems encountered during prep and their solutions✔ Educational understanding of PEDs during contest preparation✔ Complete peak week science✔ Practical peak week implementation✔ Competition day planning✔ Post-contest recovery strategies✔ Real contest prep case studies✔ Common mistakes that prevent athletes from achieving stage conditioningCourse CurriculumModule 1Introduction to Contest PreparationModule 2Starting a Contest Prep CorrectlyModule 3Nutrition for Contest PreparationModule 4Training During Contest PrepModule 5Cardio StrategyModule 6PEDs During Contest Prep (Educational Purpose Only)Module 7Monitoring Progress & Weekly AdjustmentsModule 8Managing Problems During Contest PrepModule 9Posing & PresentationModule 10Peak Week ScienceModule 11Peak Week Practical ApplicationModule 12Competition DayModule 13Post-Contest RecoveryModule 14Complete Contest Prep Case StudyModule 15Common Mistakes & Final BlueprintWho Is This Course For?• First-time bodybuilding competitors• Men\'s Physique athletes• Classic Physique athletes• Bodybuilders preparing for competition• Personal trainers• Online coaches• Prep coaches• Fitness professionals• Athletes who want to understand contest preparation scientificallyCourse Features• Professionally structured video lectures• Step-by-step educational approach• Real contest preparation examples• Practical coaching insights• Evidence-based explanations• 3 months duration• Watch anytime, anywhere• Learn at your own paceWhat Makes This Course Different?Most contest preparation advice available online focuses only on meal plans or workout routines.This course teaches the complete decision-making process behind contest preparation.You\'ll learn how experienced prep coaches think, assess, monitor, and adjust variables throughout the entire preparation rather than simply following a fixed template.The goal is not only to prepare an athlete for one competition, but to help you understand the reasoning that drives successful contest preparation.Educational DisclaimerThis course is intended for educational purposes only.Topics related to performance-enhancing drugs (PEDs) are discussed solely to improve understanding of contest preparation and should not be interpreted as medical advice, treatment recommendations, or encouragement to use such substances.Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before making decisions related to your health.InstructorCoach VarunFounder – Team Muscle FactoryFounder – The Bodybuilding DoctorWith years of experience coaching competitive athletes across multiple bodybuilding divisions, Coach Varun combines practical coaching experience with evidence-based education to simplify the complex science of contest preparation into a structured learning system.', '<p>Contest Prep Blueprint</p><h2>The Science &amp; Strategy of Competitive Bodybuilding</h2><p><strong>Contest Prep Blueprint</strong> is a comprehensive educational course designed to teach the complete science and practical application of bodybuilding contest preparation.</p><p>Whether you are a first-time competitor, an experienced athlete, a bodybuilding coach, or a fitness professional, this course provides a structured framework for understanding every phase of a successful contest preparation—from the initial assessment to stepping on stage in peak condition.</p><p>Unlike generic dieting courses, Contest Prep Blueprint explains <strong>why every decision is made</strong>, helping you understand the principles behind nutrition, training, cardio, monitoring, peak week, competition day, and post-contest recovery.</p><p>This course combines scientific knowledge with practical coaching experience, allowing you to learn the systems used during real bodybuilding contest preparations.</p><p>What You\'ll Learn</p><p>✔ How to determine the ideal time to begin contest preparation</p><p>✔ How to assess an athlete before starting prep</p><p>✔ Nutrition strategies throughout every phase of prep</p><p>✔ Training modifications required during a calorie deficit</p><p>✔ Cardio planning and progression</p><p>✔ Monitoring progress using objective data</p><p>✔ Weekly adjustment strategies</p><p>✔ Common problems encountered during prep and their solutions</p><p>✔ Educational understanding of PEDs during contest preparation</p><p>✔ Complete peak week science</p><p>✔ Practical peak week implementation</p><p>✔ Competition day planning</p><p>✔ Post-contest recovery strategies</p><p>✔ Real contest prep case studies</p><p>✔ Common mistakes that prevent athletes from achieving stage conditioning</p><p><br>Course Curriculum</p><h3>Module 1</h3><p>Introduction to Contest Preparation</p><h3>Module 2</h3><p>Starting a Contest Prep Correctly</p><h3>Module 3</h3><p>Nutrition for Contest Preparation</p><h3>Module 4</h3><p>Training During Contest Prep</p><h3>Module 5</h3><p>Cardio Strategy</p><h3>Module 6</h3><p>PEDs During Contest Prep <em>(Educational Purpose Only)</em></p><h3>Module 7</h3><p>Monitoring Progress &amp; Weekly Adjustments</p><h3>Module 8</h3><p>Managing Problems During Contest Prep</p><h3>Module 9</h3><p>Posing &amp; Presentation</p><h3>Module 10</h3><p>Peak Week Science</p><h3>Module 11</h3><p>Peak Week Practical Application</p><h3>Module 12</h3><p>Competition Day</p><h3>Module 13</h3><p>Post-Contest Recovery</p><h3>Module 14</h3><p>Complete Contest Prep Case Study</p><h3>Module 15</h3><p>Common Mistakes &amp; Final Blueprint</p><p></p><p></p><p>Who Is This Course For?</p><p>• First-time bodybuilding competitors</p><p>• Men\'s Physique athletes</p><p>• Classic Physique athletes</p><p>• Bodybuilders preparing for competition</p><p>• Personal trainers</p><p>• Online coaches</p><p>• Prep coaches</p><p>• Fitness professionals</p><p>• Athletes who want to understand contest preparation scientifically</p><p></p><p></p><p>Course Features</p><p>• Professionally structured video lectures</p><p>• Step-by-step educational approach</p><p>• Real contest preparation examples</p><p>• Practical coaching insights</p><p>• Evidence-based explanations</p><p>• 3 months duration</p><p>• Watch anytime, anywhere</p><p>• Learn at your own pace</p><p></p><p>What Makes This Course Different?</p><p>Most contest preparation advice available online focuses only on meal plans or workout routines.This course teaches the <strong>complete decision-making process</strong> behind contest preparation.You\'ll learn how experienced prep coaches think, assess, monitor, and adjust variables throughout the entire preparation rather than simply following a fixed template.</p><p>The goal is not only to prepare an athlete for one competition, but to help you understand the reasoning that drives successful contest preparation.</p><p></p><p><strong>Educational Disclaimer</strong></p><p>This course is intended for <strong>educational purposes only</strong>.</p><p>Topics related to performance-enhancing drugs (PEDs) are discussed solely to improve understanding of contest preparation and should not be interpreted as medical advice, treatment recommendations, or encouragement to use such substances.</p><p>Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before making decisions related to your health.</p><p></p><p>Instructor</p><p><strong>Coach Varun</strong><br>Founder – Team Muscle Factory<br>Founder – The Bodybuilding Doctor</p><p>With years of experience coaching competitive athletes across multiple bodybuilding divisions, Coach Varun combines practical coaching experience with evidence-based education to simplify the complex science of contest preparation into a structured learning system.</p><p></p>', 'https://thebodybuildingdoctor.com/storage/courses/0Ytsd3sOldGMr1FtWIC4sx74th27NUnf4ZssJbcz.png', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Study material', 1, 2000000, 5, 3460, 0, '2026-07-18 06:39:57', '2026-07-25 23:23:46'),
('anabolics-blueprint-global-edition', 'ANABOLICS BLUEPRINT GLOBAL EDITION', 'anabolics-blueprint-global-edition', 'ANABOLICS BLUEPRINT – GLOBAL EDITIONElite Education for Serious Athletes & Coaches Sub-headline This is not surface-level information.This is real-world pharmacology, performance science, and coaching intelligence. What You Will Learn • Hormonal environment & performance optimization• Testosterone, SHBG, Free vs Total (real application)• Compound selection & stacking logic• Orals vs Injectables – practical use cases• Fat loss vs muscle gain pharmacology• Bloodwork analysis (real athlete reports)• Side effects & risk management strategies• Cycle design (Beginner → Advanced level)• PCT & recovery science• Real case studies from athletes Who This Is For • Bodybuilders (Beginner to Advanced)• Coaches & Prep Coaches• Enhanced Athletes• Fitness Professionals who want real knowledge Why This Course is Different • Based on real athlete data, not theory• Practical + applicable knowledge• No myths, no bro-science• Designed by a coach who has handled real cases• Focus on results + safety + long-term performance Course Features • Structured modules (step-by-step learning)• Recorded lectures (accessible anytime)• Case study breakdowns• Practical frameworks & systems• Direct application for coaching & self-use Brand Authority Section TEAM MUSCLE FACTORYTHE BODYBUILDING DOCTORANABOLIC ARCC Redefining Science-Based Bodybuilding Call To Action (Very Important) Enrollment Open – Limited Access Join the Global Edition NowStart Learning What Actually Works 📩 Email: coachvarun@hotmail.com🌐 Website: www.thebodybuildingdoctor.in📲 DM to Join', '<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"491\"><strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"438\">ANABOLICS BLUEPRINT – GLOBAL EDITION</strong><br data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"441\" /><strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"491\">Elite Education for Serious Athletes &amp; Coaches</strong></p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ovrp61\" data-start=\"498\" data-end