ong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2073\">Join the Global Edition Now<br data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2039\" />Start Learning What Actually Works</p>\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2196\">📩 Email: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2137\">coachvarun@hotmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2140\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2180\">www.thebodybuildingdoctor.in</a><br data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2183\" />📲 DM to Join</p>', 'https://triotradellc.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/anabolics_blueprint_optimized-1.jpg', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Performance', 1, 5500000, 5, 0, 2, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-05 18:12:43'),
('consultation-call', 'CONSULTATION CALL', 'consultation-call', '📞 Book Your Consultation Call with Muscle Factory Team & The Bodybuilding Doctor!Ready to take your fitness journey to the next level? Our 1-on-1 consultation call is designed to provide you with expert guidance on anabolics, nutrition, training, recovery, and competition prep—tailored to your specific goals. Whether you’re a beginner or an advanced athlete, we’ll break down exactly what you need to optimize your progress while avoiding common mistakes.✅ Custom Anabolic Cycle Guidance (If applicable)✅ Personalized Diet & Training Adjustments✅ Recovery & Health Monitoring Tips✅ Peak Week & Contest Prep Strategies✅ Supplement & Blood Work Analysis🔹 No generic advice—only science-backed, experience-driven strategies!📲 Click the button below to book your consultation and get expert insights directly from us!', '<ul><li><p><strong>📞 Book Your Consultation Call with Muscle Factory Team &amp; The Bodybuilding Doctor!</strong></p><p>Ready to take your fitness journey to the next level? Our <strong>1-on-1 consultation call</strong> is designed to provide you with expert guidance on <strong>anabolics, nutrition, training, recovery, and competition prep</strong>—tailored to your specific goals. Whether you’re a beginner or an advanced athlete, we’ll break down exactly what you need to optimize your progress while avoiding common mistakes.</p><p>✅ <strong>Custom Anabolic Cycle Guidance</strong> (If applicable)<br>✅ <strong>Personalized Diet &amp; Training Adjustments</strong><br>✅ <strong>Recovery &amp; Health Monitoring Tips</strong><br>✅ <strong>Peak Week &amp; Contest Prep Strategies</strong><br>✅ <strong>Supplement &amp; Blood Work Analysis</strong></p><p>🔹 <strong>No generic advice—only science-backed, experience-driven strategies!</strong></p><p>📲 <strong>Click the button below to book your consultation and get expert insights directly from us!</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p></p>', 'https://triotradellc.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/happy-young-woman-athlete-talk-phone-gym-copy-space-scaled.jpg', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'intermediate', 'Coaching', 1, 200000, 1, 0, 5, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-05 18:13:05'),
('anabolics-blueprint', 'ANABOLICS BLUEPRINT', 'anabolics-blueprint', 'Anabolics Blueprint – The Ultimate Guide to Performance Enhancement The Anabolics Blueprint is a comprehensive course designed to educate athletes, bodybuilders, and coaches on the safe and effective use of steroids, SARMs, peptides, and hormone optimization protocols. This course breaks down everything from compound selection, proper cycle structuring, risk management, and dosage protocols to side effect prevention, post-cycle therapy (PCT), and long-term health considerations. With years of experience in coaching and competition prep, the Muscle Factory Team ensures that you get science-backed, practical knowledge instead of bro-science myths. Whether you’re a beginner looking to understand the basics or an experienced user wanting to refine your approach, this course will equip you with the right tools to maximize gains while minimizing risks. 🚀 Take control of your performance—Enroll in the Anabolics Blueprint today!', '<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"77\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"75\">Anabolics Blueprint – The Ultimate Guide to Performance Enhancement</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"520\">The <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"106\">Anabolics Blueprint</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"136\">comprehensive course</strong> designed to educate <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"196\">athletes, bodybuilders, and coaches</strong> on the <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"296\">safe and effective use of steroids, SARMs, peptides, and hormone optimization protocols.</strong> This course breaks down everything from <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"424\">compound selection, proper cycle structuring, risk management, and dosage protocols</strong> to <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"518\">side effect prevention, post-cycle therapy (PCT), and long-term health considerations.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"926\">With <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"583\">years of experience in coaching and competition prep</strong>, the <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"612\">Muscle Factory Team</strong> ensures that you get <strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"673\">science-backed, practical knowledge</strong> instead of <strong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"707\">bro-science myths.</strong> Whether you&#8217;re a <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"770\">beginner looking to understand the basics</strong> or an <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"830\">experienced user wanting to refine your approach,</strong> this course will equip you with the <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"924\">right tools to maximize gains while minimizing risks.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1008\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🚀 <strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1008\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Take control of your performance—Enroll in the Anabolics Blueprint today!</strong></p>', 'https://claaiyav3lu5dqkl.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/thumbnails/courses/9f6c6c16-9c1e-4693-8f6f-acd7772828ba.jpg', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Performance', 1, 4500000, 99, 18134, 1, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-22 12:00:09'),
('new-course-6', 'PERSONAL TRAINING (1 YEAR)', 'new-course-6', '🏆 1-Year Personal Training Package – For Enhanced & Natural Athletes Whether you’re a natural athlete or using anabolics, our 1-year personal training package is designed to optimize your physique with science-backed training, nutrition, and recovery strategies. ✅ Customized Training Plans – Tailored workouts for size, strength, or conditioning.✅ Goal-Specific Nutrition – Meal plans for lean gains, fat loss, or contest prep.✅ Performance Monitoring – Regular assessments & progress tracking.✅ Enhanced Athlete Guidance – Safe cycle planning, PCT support, and health monitoring.✅ 24/7 Support & Adjustments – Stay on track with expert guidance. 📲 Join the Muscle Factory Team & The Bodybuilding Doctor for elite coaching! 💪 Book your transformation today!', '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"0bace110-e021-4098-84e6-e5fd39a026d6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"79\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"77\">🏆 1-Year Personal Training Package – For Enhanced &amp; Natural Athletes</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"292\">Whether you&#8217;re a <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"117\">natural athlete</strong> or using <strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"140\">anabolics</strong>, our <strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"182\">1-year personal training package</strong> is designed to optimize your physique with <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"289\">science-backed training, nutrition, and recovery strategies</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"720\">✅ <strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"325\">Customized Training Plans</strong> – Tailored workouts for size, strength, or conditioning.<br data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"385\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"414\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Goal-Specific Nutrition</strong> – Meal plans for <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"473\">lean gains, fat loss, or contest prep</strong>.<br data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"477\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"505\">Performance Monitoring</strong> – Regular assessments &amp; progress tracking.<br data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"551\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"582\">Enhanced Athlete Guidance</strong> – Safe <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"644\">cycle planning, PCT support, and health monitoring</strong>.<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" />✅ <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"680\">24/7 Support &amp; Adjustments</strong> – Stay on track with expert guidance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"842\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">📲 <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"803\">Join the Muscle Factory Team &amp; The Bodybuilding Doctor for elite coaching!</strong> 💪 <strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"842\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Book your transformation today!</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 flex gap-3 -ml-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center transition-opacity group-hover/turn:opacity-100 opacity-100\"><button class=\"rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary\" aria-label=\"Read aloud\" data-testid=\"voice-play-turn-action-button\"> </button></div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'https://triotradellc.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/personal-trainer-1-compressor.jpg', '', '', 'The Bodybuilding Doctor', 'advanced', 'Training', 1, 6000000, 0, 0, 10, '2026-07-02 17:52:08', '2026-07-05 18:14:08');
